      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Mastodynia is the most frequent symptom of all breast symptoms which is experienced by a large number of women at some stage in their lives. At least 6 patterns of mastodynia can be distinguished clinically. Hormones, steroids, prolactin-inhibitors, vitamins, antioestrogen, diuretics, alternative drugs and surgery are used in therapy. But only controlled studies allow to demonstrate the effects of a therapy in comparison to a placebo response rate. Several investigators tried to find parameters to predict the response to the different therapies. The management options from the literature are discussed and evaluated."},
